        "created_at": "2026-08-12T10:44:12.325Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was a bit surprising to find that the Corrosive Codex, which offers the power ups in world content, isn’t account wide while the Altar of Corrosion which is specific to the Vault of Ulathek is when both of those are in the same place. It is even more surprising when Corrosive Souls are Warbound. Which means I could technically try to simply farm the Corrosive Souls on alts to further only one character, not saying this in a power issue situation but really a consistency issue on all the line.</p>",
